Note


Retrieval APIs (ListMemoryRecords, RetrieveMemoryRecords) require the 
fully resolved namespace. Custom namespace variables are already substituted 
at this point, so the existing bedrock-agentcore:namespace and bedrock-
agentcore:namespacePath condition keys cover the read path with no additional 
configuration.


